        "mission_intent": "Subject: Review and Update of Annual Accounting Support Fee Allocation Framework\n\nWe need the Financial Operations team to prepare a comprehensive review of our current accounting support fee allocation methodology for both the PCAOB and the designated standard-setting body (FASB). As you know, under SOX Section 109, these fees must be allocated among issuers and collected by designated collection agents to fund the recoverable budget expenses of each body, and the framework explicitly permits differentiation among different classes of issuers. Please map out our existing collection agent arrangements, confirm that fee assessments are being conducted on behalf of each body separately, and verify that total collections for each fiscal year do not exceed the respective recoverable budget expenses\u2014including operating, capital, and accrued items\u2014for either the Board or the standard-setting body. Additionally, document how our current class-of-issuer differentiation tiers are structured and whether they remain appropriate given changes in the issuer population. The deliverable should include a memo suitable for Commission review summarizing compliance status and any recommended adjustments. Please have this ready for the quarterly governance meeting.",
